  "scientific_review": [
    "All ten original Azores section/date cases remain as two westward-counterflow regional cases with ten anchors,including any unselected,gate/support-edge or primary-censored cases. Fully unsupported dated cases are retained unresolved. Frozen adjacent-only interpolation never skips gaps or extrapolates; original source connectors are not measured current lengths.",
    "The analysis was declared before fields: source stops ordered westward21,24.5,27,31,35W and only original native columns35–36.5N inside source31.5–36.5N windows. The exact subset-to-original index mapping is retained and all raw-profile pointers target unchanged original columns. Gates are exploratory rather than published axes,widths or errors; out-of-gate meanders remain unsearched.",
    "Complete original sections are first audited under their pinned eastward90degree source owner current:azores and frozen original selection/geometry. Westward270degree velocity is then recomputed from original east/north components,with missing either component kept missing. The new current:azores-countercurrent owner/frame is explicit; no source velocity metadata,old diagnosis,old selection or numeric depth is relabeled or inherited.",
    "Frozen interval selector requires finite complete native150–700m support,positive signed integral and a core above5cm/s,without a surface-speed gate. First southern native index wins ties; gate/support-edge maxima remain unresolved without weaker interior replacement. All2/5/10/20cm/s layers use the selected column with their own qualifying seed. Cutoffs are model definitions rather than confidence bounds.",
    "Comas-Rodriguez2011 primary text distinguishes subsurface westward countercurrent from eastward surface-intensified Azores flow. Its2009 density-layer extent and sampled latitude context do not validate2022 current axes or impose a bottom. Neither150m nor700m truncates connected-layer searches on the full0–5000m native axis. Keep upper/lower depths,statuses,finite brackets,supported bounds and paired spans distinct. No Mediterranean Water or thermal/density membership is inferred.",
    "A thin derived report retains candidate scores,selected diagnostics,exact original source pins/indices and a separately typed selected270degree component vector. Raw component/profile pointers remain in original files; derived component and contour pointers target the new report. This is same-field reanalysis rather than independent observational validation. Original eastward cases remain intact and methods/comparison groups are distinct.",
    "Thirty-four cloud checks in groups12/10/12 cover frozen connected layers and interval math,the source-to-inventory pipeline,opposite-frame recomputation,null handling,latitude subset boundaries and raw-index mapping,subsurface qualifying flow with a nonzero top and bottom below700m,definition/source/report mutations,original adjacency and censoring,piece/count/input pins and fixed caps. Six baseline tests passed on the same exact code commit.",
    "Immutable v14 base,fifteen prior addenda,all104 earlier scenarios,historical unresolved cases,old CSV cells and canonical depth-reference ownership lists are preserved. Every prior derived auxiliary report remains pinned,including WSC. Inventoryv16 adds one pinned addendum/CSV and the thin diagnostic report without rewriting source or frozen helpers.",
    "All source audits,component/interval/contour calculations,geometry,interpolation,inventory reconstruction and tests ran sequentially in cloud on one idle CPU. Local work prepared code,reviewed primary text/metadata,checked hashes and retained exact artifacts. No new provider field requests,local numerical field processing/tests or runtime/UI/browser work occurred. Full-source audit plus subset processing stay within original250000pair/7MB bounds; publication caps are unchanged.",
    "Geographic westward maxima can be neighboring circulation or eddies and do not independently identify a coherent named branch. Model paired span is not established physical current thickness. Two snapshots do not establish annual/seasonal envelopes,confidence limits,physical whole-route depths,matched width/depth area,volumes,state intersections or global totals. Remaining coverage,observational/seasonal validation and runtime/query integration remain unfinished."
  ],
